    "answer": {
      "short": "$13$.\n\nRequired total $4\\times8=32$; subtract the known total $5+10+4=19$.",
      "worked": "Let the missing number be $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{5+10+4+x}{4}&=8\\\\\\frac{19+x}{4}&=8\\\\19+x&=4\\times8\\\\19+x&=32\\\\x&=32-19\\\\x&=13\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
